  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niger Food Security and Emergency Access to Essential  Services Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed operation aim to address the emergency social services needs (food security, education, health) and implement state reforms. This operation will  act on two main fronts: (i) emergency assistance with immediate financing, and (ii) support for medium- term reforms in Domestic Resources Mobilization.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To maintain continuous access to adequate food, essential healthcare, and education services to people of Niger and strengthen revenue mobilization for the delivery of these services.</narrative>
  </description>
